      "id": "claim_9322479b019a4fac92ccbf3bd6a66406",
      "statement": "createRoutes in packages/server/src/routes/index.ts builds the API surface from a declared RouteMount[] table ({ prefix, middleware, router }) registered by mountRoutes, which records each layer's prefix and an authenticated flag (derived from the requiresAuth brand on mount middleware) in a WeakMap, because Express 5 hides mount prefixes in matcher closures; the same table feeds both runtime mounting and the route inventory/openapi.json.",
