      "statement": "createRoutes throws AUTH_MIDDLEWARE_REQUIRED at construction when authService or the auth middleware is missing, and applies security headers, a 1 MB request-body cap (limitBodySize(1_000_000), 413 PAYLOAD_TOO_LARGE), and a global 300 req/min per-IP express-rate-limit limiter to the whole /api router.",
