      "id": "claim_502f270619c54134b97e2a6edab14012",
      "statement": "GET /api/openapi.json is requireAuth-guarded (with its own 100 per 15 min limiter) and lazily builds and caches an OpenAPI 3.1 skeleton from the live router stack via collectRoutes + buildOpenApiSpec: Express ':param' segments become '{param}' templates, authenticated operations get a bearerAuth security requirement, and the spec intentionally contains paths/methods/auth-flags only with no request/response schemas; collectRoutes fails closed by throwing on unrecorded nested routers and non-string paths.",
