      "id": "claim_0456f84e94c843279559453f10bc0b07",
      "statement": "GET /metrics is mounted outside /api and is default-off: it responds 404 unless METRICS_TOKEN is set, then requires 'Authorization: Bearer <METRICS_TOKEN>' compared with timingSafeEqual (plain bearer because JWT auth does not fit scrapers), is rate-limited to 300 scrapes per 15 minutes per IP, and computes all gauges per scrape directly from SQLite (plus ws-clients and process gauges) so no in-process counter state exists across restarts.",
