      "id": "claim_52288e1308fe4a2e932adc3f64bf586a",
      "statement": "The WebSocket server shares the HTTP server at path /ws; the dashboard client authenticates by offering the session token as a 'bearer.<token>' subprotocol (avoiding token leakage via logs/history/referrers) and the server's handleProtocols echoes it per RFC 6455, after which WebSocketService rejects the connection with close code 4001 for missing token, 4002 for invalid token/disabled user, or 4003 for expired token, and sends an initial system.health message on success.",
