      "id": "claim_0e60095fcb844999af54fbb090a00fe9",
      "statement": "WebSocket authority is continuously re-validated, not handshake-only: every send and broadcast passes through getAuthenticatedClient, which closes the socket (4003/4002) when the token has expired, the user is disabled, role/email/organization changed, or the session sid was revoked, forcing clients to rebind through a fresh connection so stale privileges are never emitted.",
