      "id": "claim_94c85d4d70a14c7db61417bf7968536c",
      "statement": "The dashboard useWebSocket hook reconnects after 3 s only for non-auth closes while authenticated; on auth close codes it stops reconnecting, attempts exactly one refreshSession on AUTH_EXPIRED before giving up, and unwraps execution.batch envelopes to dispatch inner events individually; during SIGTERM shutdown the server closes all sockets with code 1001 plus a 5-second terminate deadline so httpServer.close() is not blocked.",
