      "statement": "The route table is verified rather than trusted: scripts/route-source-inventory.mjs statically parses createXRoutes factories and expands the mount graph from index:createRoutes at /api with a SHA-256 source fingerprint; the route-inventory.test.ts aggregator test asserts zero drift between source declarations and the instantiated router, HTTP-probes every authenticated route anonymously requiring 401, and checks the openapi.json operation count equals inventory size; scripts/contract-inventory.mjs (assurance:contracts) cross-references routes against test evidence, flags critical unclassified routes, validates the runtime inventory fingerprint, and exits nonzero on drift.",
